-- Equilibration of a compositional model with a gas-oil contact inside the
-- column (EQUIL item 10 set to 3): ZMFVD is the liquid composition, the
-- contact pressure is the saturation pressure of the contact liquid, and the
-- gas above the contact is its equilibrium vapour. Same 1x1x20 column of
-- CO2/methane/decane as EQUIL_1D_ZMFVD. There are no wells; the few short
-- time steps only verify that the initial state is stable.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   COMPOSITIONAL EQUILIBRATION WITH ZMFVD

METRIC

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
DIMENS
1 1 20 /

COMPS
3 /

START
  1 'JAN' 2016  /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

EQLDIMS
/

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT
GRIDFILE
0 1 /
DX
20*5 /

DY
20*100 /

DZ
  20*5 /

TOPS
  1*2000.0 /

PORO
  20*0.3/

PERMX
  20*2000/

PERMY
  20*2000/

PERMZ
  20*2000/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDIT
------------------------------------------------------------------------


------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

CNAMES
CO2
METHANE
DECANE
/

ROCK
68.9476
0
/

ZMFVD
-- depth  CO2  METHANE DECANE
 2000   0 0.7 0.3
 2100   0 0.3 0.7  /

RTEMP
100
/

EOS
PR /

BIC
0
0
0
/

ACF
0.22394
0.01142
0.4884
/
PCRIT
73.773
45.992
21.03
/
TCRIT
304.128
190.564
617.7
/
MW
44.00
16.04
142.28
/

VCRIT
0.09412
0.09863
0.60980
/

SGOF
-- Sg    Krg    Kro    Pcgo
0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
0.0500 0.0025 0.9025 0.0000
0.1000 0.0100 0.8100 0.0000
0.1500 0.0225 0.7225 0.0000
0.2000 0.0400 0.6400 0.0000
0.2500 0.0625 0.5625 0.0000
0.3000 0.0900 0.4900 0.0000
0.3500 0.1225 0.4225 0.0000
0.4000 0.1600 0.3600 0.0000
0.4500 0.2025 0.3025 0.0000
0.5000 0.2500 0.2500 0.0000
0.5500 0.3025 0.2025 0.0000
0.6000 0.3600 0.1600 0.0000
0.6500 0.4225 0.1225 0.0000
0.7000 0.4900 0.0900 0.0000
0.7500 0.5625 0.0625 0.0000
0.8000 0.6400 0.0400 0.0000
0.8500 0.7225 0.0225 0.0000
0.9000 0.8100 0.0100 0.0000
0.9500 0.9025 0.0025 0.0000
1.0000 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
/


STCOND
15.0 1.0 /

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPTRST
  BASIC=2 PRESSURE SOIL SGAS PSAT XMF YMF VMF ZMF POIL PGAS DENG DENO /

EQUIL
-- datum  datum   WOC    WOC    GOC    GOC
-- depth  press   depth  Pcow   depth  Pcog
   2010     150    2300   0      2050    0  3* 3   /

RPTSOL
  PRESSURE SOIL SGAS POIL PGAS DENG DENO /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Field average pressure, plus the block quantities that follow the gas-oil
-- contact: the saturations in the cells either side of it (10 and 11), the
-- pressures at the top, contact and bottom of the column, and the phase
-- densities, which respond to the changing composition.
FPR

BPR
 1 1 1 /
 1 1 10 /
 1 1 20 /
/

BSGAS
 1 1 1 /
 1 1 10 /
 1 1 11 /
/

BDENG
 1 1 1 /
/

BDENO
 1 1 20 /
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCHEDULE
------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPTSCHED
  'PRES' SGAS /

RPTRST
BASIC = 2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

TSTEP
    0.0100
    0.0200
    0.1
    0.2
/
END
